WEBVTT

00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:16,220
I'm dairy free, but would it be harmful to have a bite of cheese once every two to three weeks?

00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:24,940
Yeah, so I really believe that, I mean, there's some people that are probably almost everybody on this

00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:33,100
probably every patient I have ever had has a better diet than me most time. So I'm just being honest,

00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:40,780
but I do believe in moderation. So even if I say I go dairy free to cheat every couple of weeks

00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:45,260
when your family's having something, I don't think that's going to cause major issues. So

00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:53,900
I know that most everybody would disagree with me because you're all more disciplined than I am.

